  "body": "Experience the perfect blend of luxury, space and effortless living in this stunning brand-new family home, thoughtfully designed across three spacious levels with the convenience of a private lift connecting every floor. Offering approximately 241sqm of beautifully crafted living, this contemporary property captures breathtaking views across the sea, Rangitoto Island and Half Moon Bay, creating an exceptional lifestyle in one of East Auckland's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the home's quality craftsmanship and sophisticated design are immediately apparent. The ground floor provides excellent flexibility with a generous bedroom featuring its own ensuite and separate access, making it ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or those seeking a work-from-home option. A spacious double internal access garage completes this level.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is found on the middle floor, where light-filled open plan living seamlessly combines with a designer kitchen, spacious dining area and elegant living space. Stylish feature walls add a touch of sophistication, while a large ranch slider open onto an impressive balcony, perfectly positioned to enjoy the stunning sea views and entertain family and friends all year round.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is dedicated to comfortable family living, offering four generously proportioned bedrooms and two beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a luxurious master suite complete with its own ensuite. Every space has been designed with both comfort and functionality in mind, making this an ideal home for growing families.\r\nOutside, the easy-care landscaped grounds allow you to spend more time enjoying the coastal lifestyle and less time on maintenance. Located within the highly sought-after school zones for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, this exceptional property also places you within easy walking distance of beautiful beaches and just moments from Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services, coffee shops and local amenities.\r\n\r\nCombining premium construction, spectacular views, lift access and an unbeatable location, this is a rare opportunity to secure a brand-new luxury home in one of East Auckland's most prestigious neighbourhoods. Don't miss your chance to make this exceptional coastal property your new home.",
